      "id": 4,
      "text": "Augusta sits in the Kittatinny Valley, part of the Great Appalachian Valley, flanked by the Kittatinny Mountains to the west and the New Jersey Highlands to the east.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        9
      ],
